cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "phys-ai-dataconvertor: convert robot recordings into training datasets"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Krishniyer
    given-names: Anand
    email: akrishniyer@gmail.com
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/akrishni/phys-ai-dataconvertor"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/phys-ai-dataconvertor/"
keywords:
  - robotics
  - datasets
  - MCAP
  - ROS 2
  - LeRobot
  - imitation learning
abstract: >
  Converts ROS 2 MCAP teleoperation recordings into LeRobot v3 datasets, aligning camera frames,
  joint state and operator commands by capture time, and verifies the output with phys-ai-dataprofiler.
